{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんなーこ(*⌒▽⌒*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、ドックカフェに行ってきました。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2PE6JRHD1QWJ1D5NKZ7VA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは、ぬいぐるみのわんこです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"山形ではよくドックカフェに行っていましたが、東京に来てからは初めて行きました(*ˊᗜˋ*)/♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんこー!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2PFFF1W3QGYKWKTQ9GVF0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n黒のトイプードル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりでテンションがすごく上がりました↑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2PGPJ3R5D0CKQQYN8C63S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n白のトイプードル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"茶色のトイプードル。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2PHVJM9KZPTARB2BGEPB1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふせ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トイプードル以外にも、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2PK5ED777AE310P9931A5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nビーグル、ゴールデンレトリバー\nなど、たくさんのわんこに出会えました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わんこは癒しです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛犬に会いたくなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本では犬の鳴き声は、ワンワンですが、ルーマニアの犬の鳴き声は\nハムハム\nと言うそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとかなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⊿長沢菜々香⊿"}],"source":"archive"}